<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Universal Foods upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Universal Foods upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards said on Thursday it upgraded its rating on the shares of Universal Foods Corp to a buy from a maintain for conservative accounts.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Univeral Food shares were up 1-1/8 at 38-5/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
